<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How Trust-Wise earns money through affiliate links.">
  <section class="wrap page prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p>Trust-Wise participates in affiliate programmes including the Shopee Affiliate Program and hotel and travel booking partners. When you click a link and make a purchase or booking, we may receive a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
    <p>Commissions never change our recommendations. Prices and availability are set by the merchant and can change at any time — always confirm details on the merchant's site before you buy.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
